Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:06.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I want to know what future \Nawaits me, the villainess,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:10.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and I want to see how this game ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.12,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,And to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:16.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I need to talk to King Pearl once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:35.39,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:53.01,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\pos(320,123)\c&HB36BF7&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Always{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}and {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Forever{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:55.83,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:58.42,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:07.25,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I took the form of a woman \Nbecause you said you hated men,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:08.98,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,but I don't need to anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:16.32,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl, no one would condemn a fairy king \Nfor creating a natural disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:21.02,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's possible that people just \Ndeem them necessary sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:21.87,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:26.83,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,it's not good to involve humans \Nin a problem between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.84,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Why is it always just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.57,0:02:35.10,Italics,Pearl INT,0,0,0,,It started with the selfish \Ndemands of the sea fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:37.83,Flashback,Sea FairyA FB,0,0,0,,I want Icilla to be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:42.62,Italics,Pearl INT,0,0,0,,But I would never separate two people \Nwho love each other so deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:46.21,Italics,Pearl INT,0,0,0,,That's just how it is... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:50.77,Italics,Pearl INT,0,0,0,,when I saw Claire having so much fun \Nwith people other than me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:55.35,Italics,Pearl INT,0,0,0,,I always thought that fairy kings \Nwere lonely beings...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:58.25,Italics,Pearl INT,0,0,0,,but I'm the only one who's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:02.66,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I'm just fine alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:04.78,Italics,Claire INT,0,0,0,,Pearl...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:07.95,Italics,Claire INT,0,0,0,,I know you long for company \Nmore than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:12.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:13.63,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Please pardon our intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.23,0:03:17.01,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose. Icilla Pearllant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? Are you, \Nby any chance... King Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:24.23,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes. This is my original appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.19,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Why have you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:36.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm here because I want to \Nsee everything through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.02,0:03:40.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua remained on land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:43.91,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,so he could take command in \Npreventing chaos among the populace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:48.31,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed he'd overcome \Nthe secret elixir's effects himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:50.53,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.66,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:55.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm just a humble villainess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:57.51,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Of course, I can't tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But there's one thing I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:04.56,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The only one I love is Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:09.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So there is nothing that you need \Nto be concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:11.83,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:14.68,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,How lucky you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:18.65,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,You have a man who thinks \Nof you and you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:28.23,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,The one I desired left me, saying \Nwe were too far apart in standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.76,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,"A human and a fairy king \Ncan never be together."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:36.38,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,That's what he said before \Nchoosing a human woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:41.44,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,He said he didn't want to forget me, \Nso he took my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:46.47,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I have no need for a love \Nthat is neither here nor there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:51.15,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,My name is... Icilla Pearllant...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:58.00,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Does this mean someone among my ancestors \Ndeclined marriage with King Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:04.12,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I had no idea King Pearl endured \Nsuch a tragic romance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:06.44,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,That is in the past now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:18.01,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:20.04,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,A coral accessory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:24.09,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I chose it because \NI thought it would suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.09,0:05:25.01,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:30.74,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose taught me that \Nthe woman I love would be happier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:33.23,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,with a gift that I chose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:39.99,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I knew it! It suits you perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:43.41,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Could it be that you \Nwere jealous of Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:50.87,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you loved me so much \Nthat you'd blacken the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:53.55,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I thought it was because you hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:56.38,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,O-Of course I don't hate—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:06:01.11,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,But in this case, you need \Nto understand what you've done
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:04.13,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,and accept punishment as a fairy king.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.64,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:12.10,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Could you please allow me \Nto choose King Pearl's punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.98,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be lighter \Nthan the punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:17.73,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,she'd receive from a fairy king.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:24.15,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Icilla Pearllant, I'm afraid \NI cannot agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:29.16,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,A human cannot be permitted to \Nhave a say in what happens to Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:32.64,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Do not think a human can tie Pearl down,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:37.36,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,especially one who is \Na descendant of Pearllant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.73,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:44.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire, Lady Icilla is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:48.38,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I only \Nreturned her to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:52.52,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose, you said you \Nwanted to see all this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:56.68,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,For that reason, I will allow your \Npresence here until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:59.73,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:03.17,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,And? What is my punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:05.95,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're accepting it \Ngracefully, Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:09.47,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What happened was my own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.29,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:17.15,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,give Aquasteed and Tiararose \Nthe blessing of the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:20.71,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That's the punishment \NI've come up with for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.33,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:28.48,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind never to \Ngive my blessing to any humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:32.18,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Well, I'm quite fond of the \NKingdom of Marinforest, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:35.96,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,The Sky Fairy King \Nhas blessed the crown prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:39.70,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,and his consort has the \NForest Fairy King on her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:45.08,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So if the Sea Fairy King \Nwould also bless them both,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:46.94,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,this kingdom would have peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:50.58,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So bless them with all your might, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:55.13,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,But if I do that, it will nearly \Ndeplete my magic power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:58.75,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes. That's what makes it a punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:03.94,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's a punishment, {\i1}and{\i0} it \Nhelps this kingdom flourish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:05.46,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Everyone wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:10.45,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Claire... You like this kingdom \Na bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:14.75,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,But if that is what you desire...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.15,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Ocean of ripples and waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:25.80,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,bestow the highest of blessings \Nupon the two
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.76,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,who shoulder the future of Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:33.74,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,For Aquasteed Marinforest, \Na water blade that can pierce all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:39.85,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,and for Tiararose Lapis Marinforest, \Na water wall that can deflect all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:43.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I feel so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:46.27,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose, try to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:48.22,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You just need to take in Pearl's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.07,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There doesn't seem to be any mass chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:05.07,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Yes, thankfully, there weren't very many \Npeople who personally saw the black ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:08.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That's good. I'll travel \Naround the city just in ca—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.37,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:16.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's the blessing of the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:20.84,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Claire mentioned it before, \Nbut this impact...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.67,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Tiara must be receiving it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Elliot, I'm heading back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.71,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:29.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:34.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.76,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:42.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:45.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:47.94,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You received the Sea Fairy \NKing's blessing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:50.04,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You don't feel unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No, it did take me by surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:55.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but I'm not unwell in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.37,0:10:02.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.59,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:12.59,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I am sincerely sorry for causing \Nso many problems for the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:15.28,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Please punish me as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:18.73,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The punishment for Pearl, \Nthe Sea Fairy King,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:21.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,was decided by Claire, the Sky Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:25.37,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I received the blessing \Nof the ocean's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:28.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I received an attack-focused blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:33.29,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I have always overseen \Nthe seas and beaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.07,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,but I see that is no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:40.42,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Because the two of you have received \Nthe Sea Fairy King's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:45.39,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,No, I'd like you to continue \Nmanaging the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.33,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:50.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You know it better \Nthan anyone else, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:52.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.59,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:58.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're the right one \Nfor the job. After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:02.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,there's no one who loves \Nthe ocean as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:07.40,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara has the forest to look after,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:09.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,so she won't have time \Nto oversee the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:12.10,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We'll have increased \Ndiplomatic relations, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:16.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I don't want to be at the mercy \Nof the fairy kings any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:21.08,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I guess he wants me to stay at \Nthe castle and not go to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:25.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Before, I never would have \Neven imagined this happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:30.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm sure she only agreed to use \Nthe elixir in a moment of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:33.51,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Either that, or it's just \Nthe power of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:39.15,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Sometimes I suspect that what the game \Nmandates is just what someone wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and that worries me, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:48.48,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,If that is what the two of you desire, \Nthen I humbly accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:50.94,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We'll be counting on you, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.55,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I guess that's case closed for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.95,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.34,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Huh? I can't mo—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:17.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He usually wakes up before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:18.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This is rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:22.69,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,His eyelashes are so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:25.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.45,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I brought you flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:34.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,K-K-Keith! Why are you in our bedroom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:39.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Do fairy kings know nothing \Nof common courtesy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.75,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:45.89,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Does the crown prince of this kingdom \Nnot believe that fairy kings are absolute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:48.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I will not compromise \Nwhen it comes to Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:51.41,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm the only one allowed to see her \Nwhen she first wakes up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:55.13,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Heh. What a selfish crown prince you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:56.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I don't need that from a fairy king
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:13:00.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,who enters a married couple's \Nbedroom without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:04.44,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If you have business with us, wait in \Nanother room until we've changed clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:06.97,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:17.86,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,It's sugar gathered from your flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:20.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You brought that much sugar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:23.55,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Also, it's only a tiny bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:25.61,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,but you can gather their nectar, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:26.83,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Even nectar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:30.50,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,And the petals are also edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.58,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It really is your flower, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.15,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,They have a faint sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less of Tiara's flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Every part of it is sweet, just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:48.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're the only one who \Nwould describe me as sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:55.23,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,As much as I enjoy watching Tiara, \Ncould you do that somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:01.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,With these, maybe I can \Nmake a new dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:05.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll try a taste first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:12.51,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The sweet, gentle flavor fills my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:16.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Maybe a hard candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Now for some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:26.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Maybe... if I dig deep into my magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:36.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I did it! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:41.93,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Once they're a lovely golden color,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.57,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'll wrap them in petals, \Ncool them, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:45.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,they're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:49.04,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,What are these sweets called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:50.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Tortoiseshell candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:53.31,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,They're so pretty, \Nand they look delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:55.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Philine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:58.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Let's take them to Prince Aqua right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:04.81,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,His Highness is on the beach supervising \Nthe transplanting of your trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:09.00,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.65,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:16.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:20.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The new sweets I made are done, \Nso I brought them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:22.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They're tortoiseshell candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I wanted you to be \Nthe first one to try them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,They're a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:28.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:31.59,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Beautiful, cute, and tasty-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:38.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua, aren't you \Nstill in the middle of work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We'll take our time \Nwhen I'm finished, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:54.16,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I was looking at the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:59.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I was so moved the first time \NI saw the ocean in Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it was so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:07.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It looks so beautiful because \Nit's King Pearl's ocean, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:14.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Some days will be sunny, \Nand others stormy with cold rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:19.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,This ocean is King Pearl's \Nloving heart itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's why it touches the heart so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:26.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love King Pearl's ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:31.87,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'd like to give some of these \Ntortoiseshell candies to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.19,0:16:38.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Eating delicious sweets \Nalways cheers me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:41.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I hope these will calm her soul, \Neven if only a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.52,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:47.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:50.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,After I just said I wanted you \Nto eat them first...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Should I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:54.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara... You are too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:57.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You can do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:04.42,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.64,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:27.15,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The beach is regenerating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:35.39,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's Pearl's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:39.04,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,This is a farewell gift from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:51.59,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl has given her blessing to the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:55.30,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,using the last bit \Nof magic she had left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,She used up all her magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:01.37,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,...and went into a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.35,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.25,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Now there's no way to know \Nwho's really being punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:10.11,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:12.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:15.33,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose, could you give me \Nthe sweets intended for Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:16.40,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:35.61,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm hoping it will reach her this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:44.73,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I pray for blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:48.27,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,upon King Pearl's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.95,Default,Noble1,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed and Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:57.16,Default,Noble1,0,0,0,,I hear you've both received blessings \Nfrom the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:19:00.78,Default,Noble2,0,0,0,,Now Marinforest's future is secure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:05.97,Default,Lady2,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, you look like a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:09.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you. I feel so happy and reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:12.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:19.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What is it? I feel like \Nsomething's calling for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:29.40,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,This is... a letter from Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:34.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,She's written all about her happy days \Nwith Prince Hartknights in Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:37.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's so like Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:40.62,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,By the way, Lady Tiara,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.99,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,is everything going well \Nbetween you and Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:47.52,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,If the sequel's heroine tries \Nto pull anything, don't give in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:51.50,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,And watch out for the love \Npotion event, especially!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:56.16,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Lady Akari... I wish you'd \Nsent this letter a bit sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:20:00.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,So that really was an event in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:02.78,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,Once you receive \Nthe Fairy King's blessings,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.88,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,you unlock a hidden stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.77,Akari Letter,Akari NA,0,0,0,,Have you done that yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:09.62,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A hidden stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.92,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She writes about what \Nwill happen from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:13.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If I know what's going to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:19.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,maybe I can avoid the game's adjustments \Nand secure a happy future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.02,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:22.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:26.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:30.27,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:32.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:35.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You seem a bit uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:41.28,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, never forget
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:44.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,that I will always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:47.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,In sickness and in health.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:52.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,And I want to share all of your joy, \Nsadness, and pain with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.82,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,For as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:59.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:08.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love you with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:17.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for choosing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:23.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to be with you, \NPrince Aqua... no, Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:28.89,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it... You are just too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Would you dance with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:35.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,There's no way the story of a villainess
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:53.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,who's adored by the prince \Nof a neighboring kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,exists in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:21:59.38,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But no matter what sort of story unfolds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,as long as I'm with Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:05.25,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:14.79,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(916,624)\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\bord1.5\c&HFFF8EB&\3c&H6A6867&\b1\blur2\pos(531,73.783)}Translation:\NTiming:\NEditing and Typesetting:\NQuality Control:\NTranslation Check:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:14.79,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(916,624)\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\bord1.5\c&HFFF8EB&\3c&H6A6867&\b1\blur2\pos(549,73.783)}Rebecca Cottrill\NMariana Martinez\NAshley Barboza\NS Bilyeu\NRei Miyasaka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:24.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:27.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
